Move all rcc helper functions into stm32mp1_rcc_util.h file

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 22567e0f271213a0f69150077c34be9894fe861f plat-stm32mp1: create helper file for stm32mp1]
Change-Id: I9c7c6b65230c29f866cdee788c8d34d1cb12e4b2
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
---
